# HELP-NOT: --emit-static-reference-program
# HELP-NOT: --verify-spmd-program

# VERIFY: wafer-compile-stablehlo: verified frontend program

# GRAPH: wafer-compile-stablehlo: graph break rejected
# GRAPH: python control flow escaped capture

# EAGER: wafer-compile-stablehlo: eager fallback rejected
# EAGER: aten fallback remained in capture

# DYNAMIC: wafer-compile-stablehlo: unbounded dynamic shape rejected
# DYNAMIC: func.func @unbounded_dynamic

# BAD-BOUND: wafer-compile-stablehlo: invalid dynamic bound rejected
# BAD-BOUND: func.func @bad_dynamic_bound argument 0

# PROGRAM: wafer-compile-stablehlo: verified StableHLO program directory parameters: 1
# PROGRAM: wafer-compile-stablehlo: verified StableHLO program

# ZERO-SHAPES: wafer-compile-stablehlo: verified StableHLO program directory parameters: 2
# ZERO-SHAPES: wafer-compile-stablehlo: verified StableHLO program

# RAW-SIZE-OVERFLOW: npy tensor byte size is not representable: data/weight

# UNSAFE-PARAMETER: wafer-compile-stablehlo: program directory metadata rejected
# UNSAFE-PARAMETER: parameter location name must be a safe single path component

# BAD-NAME: program metadata name must be 'forward'

# INPUT-POSITIONS: wafer-compile-stablehlo: program directory metadata rejected
# INPUT-POSITIONS: input_arg positions must be unique and contiguous from zero

# SHARD-PROGRAM: wafer-compile-stablehlo: verified StableHLO program directory parameters: 1
# SHARD-PROGRAM: wafer-compile-stablehlo: verified StableHLO program directory parameter shards: 1
# SHARD-PROGRAM: wafer-compile-stablehlo: verified StableHLO program

# BOUNDARY-WITHOUT-MARKER: distributed_boundary requires a post-SPMD marker
# BAD-BOUNDARY-IDENTITY: distributed boundary result_index is out of range
# DUPLICATE-BOUNDARY-PARTITION: duplicate distributed boundary partition_id
# BAD-BOUNDARY-LOCAL: distributed boundary local_shape does not match module and metadata

# DUPLICATE-SHARD-RECORD: duplicate parameter shard metadata record for parameter argument

# SHARD-SIZE-OVERFLOW: parameter shard global tensor byte size is not representable

# OVERLAP-SHARDS: parameter shard slices overlap

# GAP-SHARDS: parameter shard slices do not cover the global tensor

# REPLICA-SHARDS: partitioned parameter shard replica_id must be 0

# REPLICATED: wafer-compile-stablehlo: verified StableHLO program directory parameter shards: 1
# REPLICATED: wafer-compile-stablehlo: verified StableHLO program

# MISMATCHED-REPLICA: replicated parameter shard payloads must be byte-identical

# MISSING-SHARDS: wafer-compile-stablehlo: program directory metadata rejected
# MISSING-SHARDS: partitioned StableHLO program directory is missing parameter shards

# MISSING-SHARD-FILE: wafer-compile-stablehlo: program directory metadata rejected
# MISSING-SHARD-FILE: parameter shard file is missing

# PROGRAM-SHAPE: wafer-compile-stablehlo: program directory metadata rejected
# PROGRAM-SHAPE: shape mismatch for function argument 0

# PROGRAM-DATA: wafer-compile-stablehlo: program directory metadata rejected
# PROGRAM-DATA: parameter data file is missing: weight

# CONSTANT-PROGRAM: wafer-compile-stablehlo: verified StableHLO program directory parameters: 0
# CONSTANT-PROGRAM: wafer-compile-stablehlo: verified StableHLO program directory constants: 1
# CONSTANT-PROGRAM: wafer-compile-stablehlo: verified StableHLO program

# PROGRAM-CONSTANT-DATA: wafer-compile-stablehlo: program directory metadata rejected
# PROGRAM-CONSTANT-DATA: constant data file is missing: constants/0
